  "description": "LEVELS OF ASSISTANCE AND AUTONOMY Three power levels to optimally manage electric assistance according to needs, with a range of up to 120 km. MOTOR OLI PICO is the drive unit specifically designed for light urban mobility. So small and well integrated into the frame, it makes a SYDNEY look like a traditional bike. With 250W of power, a maximum torque of 70 Nm, and a weight of 2.5 kg, it optimally assists pedaling, ensuring a smooth and natural riding style. DRUMS BE21 SYDNEY is equipped with a 504 Wh battery, perfectly integrated into the frame.\n\nBE GREEN TECHNOLOGIES The 27.5\" low-step aluminum frame is robust yet lightweight, ensuring easy handling and comfort for a ride style very similar to a traditional bicycle. Equipped as standard with mudguards, front and rear pannier racks, and a lighting system, it allows for smooth riding in traffic, even in the evening. A front suspension fork and 8-speed Shimano gears complete the urban setup. The drive unit is OLI PICO, perfectly integrated into the frame, providing efficient and discreet pedal assistance, and is paired with a 504 Wh integrated battery for a range of up to 120 km. IDEAL FOR SYDNEY is the answer to urban mobility needs. Ideal for daily commutes in the city center, it provides the necessary assistance to move nimbly through traffic with comfort and safety. PERFECT FOR YOU IF If you're looking for a powerful yet affordable e-bike that's comfortable and reliable, perfect for your daily commute, running errands in the city center, and medium-range trips.",
